# datastore/

Core data persistence layer for Udex providing PostgreSQL-backed storage with migrations, transaction support, and comprehensive integration testing. Abstracts database operations through a trait-based interface with configuration management and migration versioning.

## Dirs

- `migrations/` -- SQL migration files for database schema versioning
- `src/` -- Core datastore implementation with trait definitions and PostgreSQL adapter
- `tests/` -- Integration tests for datastore functionality

## Files

- `Cargo.toml` -- Package configuration with postgres feature and dependencies
- `build.rs` -- Build script enforcing recompilation on migration directory changes
- `README.md` -- Development and usage documentation with test setup instructions
